# PWM jurisdiction profile: European Union
#
# Data, not ontology. Maps the European Union investor categories that PWM defines to the generic
# retail and non-retail categories that cross-jurisdiction rules use. Each category's legal
# source is in its definition in pwm.ttl. Disclosure triggers and cross-border rules are not
# asserted here: whether and when a firm must disclose AI use, and which activities may be
# carried out across a border, is the firm's compliance function's decision, recorded in the
# firm's own rules (pack policies, PolicyRule records). A profile never adds an axiom to the ontology.
# Status: derived from the PWM code lists; not independently verified against the legal texts.

@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix pwm:     <https://ahmedmuzammil.com/ontology/pwm#> .
@prefix pwmprof: <https://ahmedmuzammil.com/ontology/pwm/profiles#> .

<https://ahmedmuzammil.com/ontology/pwm/profiles/jurisdictions/eu> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:title "PWM jurisdiction profile: European Union"@en ;
    pwmprof:jurisdictionCode "EU" ;
    pwmprof:status "derived from PWM code lists; not independently verified" .

pwm:RetailClientEU skos:broader pwm:RetailCategory .
pwm:ProfessionalClientEU skos:broader pwm:NonRetailCategory .
pwm:EligibleCounterpartyEU skos:broader pwm:NonRetailCategory .
